our time, using both clues and logic to bring these supernatural powers to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360110/extras/b3da3d3ae07df2fb5da0aa3dd9233a06.webp?t=1754629811\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Complete your Report]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through this Dice Eater game with its cards and dice to complete your report using your research and the comments you get from your opponent. Once you've gathered enough information to make your opponent forfeit, that will be the time to strike using logical deduction.<br><strong> </strong><br><strong>Use your deduction skills to uncover your opponent's supernatural abilities! </strong><br><strong>Use your findings about these abilities to turn the tables and win the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Streaming Guide]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Staffer Series is free to stream, regardless of length of stream, as long as the contents don't include the following:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifying the game code or doctoring of the game contents through reverse engineering, hacking, or other means.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plans to undermine the story of the game by distorting the main storyline or using broadcasting centered around gore or adult themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claiming to be an officially sanctioned stream without prior consultation with the dev team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The following content is not mandatory to include, but would be greatly appreciated:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would be grateful if you could let us know your plans to stream on our official Discord channel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you could introduce the game information or URL in the introduction of your broadcast, that would be of great help to our team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official SNS hashtag is <i>#StafferSeries #DiceEater</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The following actions are not authorized in any form, not limited to game streaming</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using any of the included contents for AI training.</p></li></ul>",
